get.description:
Download the chosen schema as JSON.

``kind=base`` (default) returns ``Asset.universal_schema``;
``kind=simplified_mesh`` returns the matching variant payload.

patch.description:
Patch the environment's base universal schema at a JSON Pointer path.

Body:
    {"op": "add"|"replace", "path": "/collision_config/excludes", "value": [...]}

Returns:
    {"schema": <updated schema>, "updated": {"op": "...", "path": "..."}}

